  "sourceTitle": "Chili Tortilla Casserole",
  "sourceText": "Chili Tortilla Casserole\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Saturday, January 2, 2010 - 12:45am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 pound ground beef\n1 can (1 lb.) tomatoes\n1 can (8 oz.) tomato sauce\n1 can (6 oz.) tomato paste\n1 can (15 ½ oz.) dark red kidney beans\n1 can (12 oz.) whole kernel corn\n1/2 cup pitted sliced olives\n1 tablespoon chili powder\n2 teaspoons sugar\n1 teaspoon salt\n1/4 teaspoon pepper\n12 (1, 10 oz. pkg.) soft corn tortillas\n1 1/2 cups (6 oz.) shredded Cheddar cheese\nSliced avocado, optional\n\nPreparation\n\n1 For chili mixture brown ground beef; drain off excess fat. Add remaining sauce ingredients. Simmer 15 minutes.",
